From 4f08813c4f50e3c27b6f54140462638e06b4119f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 21:13:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 33/78] Port Dispel Magic (H085+$3ED4) and the combat map cell
 lookup

Dispel Magic removes the timed effects of the target and the caster's
clouds around $2518/$251A; H048+$0154 reads a cell of the combat map.
H005+$2ADE (combat map) and H005+$2514 (cloud list) become C globals;
without a combat map a cell reads as 0.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013G8KST8dgGfenpqx3RukYi
